SY_TALK("xs_Yrx64oaM",[[6,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[20,["You have to know that truth is what it is."]],[29,["We cannot conceptualize it with our human","awareness."]],[35,["We cannot order it, we cannot manipulate it,","we cannot organize it."]],[43,["It is what it is, has been and will be."]],[48,["And what is the truth?"]],[51,["Truth is that we are surrounded or we are","penetrated or we are nourished, looked after"]],[65,["and loved by a very subtle energy which is","the energy of divine love."]],[79,["The second truth is that we are not this body,","this mind, these conditionings, this ego,"]],[92,["but we are the spirit."]],[98,["You don’t have to accept what I’m saying","blindly, because blind faith leads to fanaticism."]],[107,["But as scientists you must keep your minds","open and see for yourself what I’m saying:"]],[117,["if it is so, honestly you must accept it."]],[129,["We know so much through science about our","civilization, our advancement."]],[144,["This is the advancement of a tree which has","grown outside very much; but if we do not"]],[153,["know our roots, we’ll be destroyed."]],[161,["So it is important to know about our roots."]],[166,["And this is what it is that I would say are","our roots."]],[173,["As you can see, there are seven centers within","us, and these subtle centers are placed in"]],[197,["the spinal cord and the brain."]],[204,["These cater to our physical, mental, emotional","and spiritual needs."]],[210,["On the physical side they manifest the energy","for the use of our plexuses which look after"]],[221,["our physical problems."]],[223,["That is on the right side, the energy which","is supplied by this yellow line, a subtle"]],[237,["channel – we call it as the Pingala Nadi","– this supplies energy for our physical"]],[247,["and mental actions."]],[251,["So this is the power of action within us which","also caters to the right sympathetic nervous"]],[260,["system."]],[263,["The another channel you see on the left-hand","side is the channel by which we desire, put"]],[272,["our energy to our desire."]],[275,["So this is the power of desire and looks after","our emotions."]],[282,["This is the one which looks after our conditionings","also."]],[289,["At the end of these two channels they create","two institutions: one on the right side crosses"]],[299,["over, and the yellow balloon that you see","is the ego, is the balloon of ego that we"]],[307,["have; and the left-hand side one that, which","conditions our mind is the balloon of superego."]],[316,["As we start growing, in age by the time we","are twelve years of age, these two completely"]],[325,["meet and the soft bone in our head becomes","completely calcified."]],[336,["Now there’s third energy within us which","is in the center, and this central energy"]],[351,["is the one which has made us human beings."]],[355,["And these centers are the milestones of our","evolution."]],[362,["So now the last jumping is left out."]],[370,["It has reached up to the limbic area."]],[375,["Now, only thing, it has to break through the","soft bone in the, on the head and break through"]],[395,["that, which is the actualization of baptism."]],[401,["Baptism is not an artificial thing – it","is an actualization."]],[409,["But the energy that does it is, we call it","sleeping energy, in the triangular bone called"]],[423,["as sacrum."]],[425,["That means the Greeks knew that this is a","sacred bone, that they called it “sacrum.”"]],[434,["This energy has to rise and break through","that fontanel bone area and connect us to"]],[444,["that subtle divine Power which we have never","felt during human awareness."]],[454,["Thus we get connected to this divine Power,","and we start feeling it on our fingertips."]],[467,["It’s described in the Koran that “at the","time of resurrection your hands will speak,"]],[476,["and they will give witness against you.”"]],[479,["That is, you start feeling your own centers","– these are five, six and seven centers"]],[485,["– and they indicate what’s wrong with","you within yourself, what’s the problem."]],[494,["Also you can feel the cool breeze coming out","of your head, cool breeze of the Holy Ghost."]],[504,["Because this sleeping power which is called","as the kundalini – “kundala” means “coils”"]],[515,["– is the power of pure desire within us."]],[521,["[Disturbance by a man in the audience]"]],[530,["What’s he talking?"]],[534,["Ah …. This is the result, you know, of tensions,","on modern tensions."]],[546,["So many such things are happening."]],[549,["People have no peace."]],[550,["That’s what I say, the tree has outgrown","itself: it must find its roots."]],[561,["In America they say there are fifty-five per","cent people who suffer from terrible nervousness,"]],[569,["and at least thirty per cent people have got","schizophrenia."]],[574,["It’s a very dangerous thing."]],[581,["If we don’t understand how delicately we","are made and to realize that we are human"]],[589,["beings, the epitome of evolution, we are going","to land in great difficulties."]],[597,["We may try to run away from reality, but reality","will have an effect on us."]],[605,["Now, so now we have this kind of a mechanism","within us existing."]],[615,["Now this is a living process of evolution,","and you must understand that we don’t pay"]],[624,["for living process, and we can’t even explain","it; because when you take a small little seed"]],[633,["and put it in the Mother Earth, it germinates","by itself spontaneously."]],[639,["You don’t pay to the Mother Earth anything."]],[645,["And when it germinates, it grows into a tree","and produces thousands of seeds."]],[653,["So in that little seed the map of all the","things it was going to create is there."]],[662,["How it works, we never ask this question."]],[666,["We take all the things for granted."]],[668,["We don’t even ask the question how this","wonderful eye of ours is made like a camera,"]],[676,["and that how we are programmed within ourselves","like computers."]],[682,["You see this is the color; you don’t have","to think about – it’s there."]],[688,["Through our sensory organs, how we find out","things: we’d never question it."]],[701,["But to answer now all our questions, we have","to become the divine computer."]],[711,["And that’s why we have to be connected to","the mains, I call them, as the people who"]],[716,["are self-realized, the people who have got","their spirit in their attention."]],[729,["When the attention is enlightened through","this happening, then you can see the absolute"]],[739,["truth."]],[740,["Like supposing you are holding on to a snake","and there’s darkness, and somebody tells,"]],[747,["there is darkness, “But you have got a snake","in your hand."]],[754,["I can see it.”"]],[756,["He’ll say, “No, I think it is a rope.”"]],[760,["Now if you put on the light, immediately that","person will drop."]],[767,["In the same way, when the attention gets enlightened","by the spirit, the first nature, innate nature"]],[775,["of the spirit is that it manifests absolute","truth."]],[782,["You immediately become so empowered that you","give up all those habits which are destructive"]],[788,["to your life – immediately."]],[791,["I have seen people giving up drugs overnight","in London, alcoholism, all kinds of things."]],[798,["I was amazed the way it’s working."]],[804,["It’s your own power within you; it just","there, is existing."]],[812,["There’s no obligation of any kind, it’s","just one enlightened candle can enlighten"]],[821,["another candle."]],[822,["That’s how it works."]],[825,["And it has to work – otherwise, as I told","you, we are standing on the brink of destruction."]],[832,["Leave alone things like drugs and things we","take to escape reality, there are so many"]],[840,["diseases that have come up and coming up that","it is going to be very difficult for us to"]],[851,["exist on this Mother Earth after some time:","ecological problems, the uncertainty of life,"]],[862,["the insecurities that are built within us."]],[867,["So many conditionings we have."]],[871,["How to get rid of them?"]],[874,["How to be cleansed is a very big problem today."]],[878,["And for that I think it is important that","we have to get our Self-realization."]],[886,["We talk, “my, my body, my hand, my mind,","my ego” – but which is this “my”?"]],[896,["Which is the “I” behind it?"]],[899,["And when doctors also talk about the autonomous","nervous system, they don’t say what is this"]],[904,["auto, who is this auto."]],[906,["We say “automobile” – so there is a","driver sitting driving the car."]],[910,["But who is driving this car?"]],[914,["That is what we have to find out."]],[918,["And that auto is the spirit within us."]],[922,["Unless and until the connection with the Divine","is established, all other efforts are really"]],[932,["fruitless."]],[933,["And that’s why many people ask Me why all","the religions are fighting among themselves,"]],[938,["why people who believe in God are fighting","among themselves; why they are so sinful,"]],[946,["why aren’t they so good."]],[947,["The reason is, they have not found the truth","as yet."]],[953,["Just believing in any God or being born in","any religion doesn’t make you a righteous"]],[959,["person at all: anybody following any religion","can commit any sin."]],[965,["There’s no bondage."]],[966,["But when this kundalini rises into that green","part, as you see – we call it as a Void:"]],[972,["is the area which is like a bridging."]],[975,["Very significant it is, like Moses bridged;","in the same way, this is the bridging."]],[983,["And this bridging, when it takes place you","can cross over this ocean of illusion, as"]],[989,["we say."]],[990,["But actually this ocean of illusion is representing","our ten valencies within us."]],[998,["We have ten valencies, ten dharmas, ten – our","innate nature as human beings."]],[1009,["So when kundalini rises into this area, it","enlightens this area, and a person who is"]],[1015,["a realized soul doesn’t do anything wrong."]],[1018,["He doesn’t cheat, he doesn’t bribes, he’s","not frightened."]],[1023,["He’s so courageous, he’s so compassionate,","he’s so dynamic, he’s so loving."]],[1032,["This is only possible when you are innately","religious."]],[1038,["Unless and until that happens, the religion","outside, the man-made religion, cannot give"]],[1044,["you what it is promising you."]],[1047,["And that’s why people are surprised that","there is a big difference between the practice"]],[1051,["and precepts of religion."]],[1053,["Every religion has said that “you seek your","Self.”"]],[1060,["So there was nothing wrong with all the prophets,","incarnations, all the saints."]],[1065,["They all said the same thing."]],[1069,["But we have missed the point."]],[1073,["Everything has become either money-oriented","or is an intellectual, intellectual probing."]],[1083,["It is through intellectual probing you reach","a point where you realize that you have not"]],[1088,["reached the reality."]],[1090,["So what should we do?"]],[1096,["And this is a very great gift of modern times","which was promised long time back."]],[1101,["Is described already in our Puranas that at","the time, these modern times called as Kali"]],[1110,["Yuga, the Paramachaitanya or this all-pervading","Power will become active – means there is"]],[1118,["Krita Yuga, it will become active – and","through it thousands of people will get their"]],[1128,["realization."]],[1130,["Even in the Bible they have said that it’s","quite a limited number."]],[1134,["John the – John has written in his “Revelation”","it’s quite a limited number, but we have"]],[1141,["already crossed that."]],[1145,["And so many people have to become realized","souls."]],[1148,["It’s very important today, and it’s so","easy – Sahaja."]],[1155,["“Saha” is “with”, “ja” is “born.”"]],[1158,["Born with you is the right to become one with","the Divine, united with the Divine – that"]],[1165,["is yoga."]],[1167,["“Yoga” is nothing but to be united with","that divine Power."]],[1172,["That’s what yoga is; all other things are","subsidiary."]],[1180,["This union brings forth new dimensions on","our central nervous system."]],[1191,["As a evolution, we always develop a new dimension."]],[1196,["By this you develop a new awareness of collective","consciousness, by which you can feel other"]],[1208,["people, their centers."]],[1211,["Sitting down here you can feel the center","of somebody – somebody who is dead, even"]],[1216,["you can feel his centers and find out what","he was: was he a realized soul or not?"]],[1221,["You can find out about anybody whether he","was a realized soul or not, sitting down here."]],[1226,["You have to just think about him, put your","hands."]],[1228,["If you are a realized soul you can feel on","your fingertips what is the problem."]],[1235,["And somehow if you know how to correct those","problems, you get rid of your own diseases"]],[1241,["and the diseases of others, your own problems","and the problems of others."]],[1249,["First you enter into a state of mind which","we call as “thoughtless awareness.”"]],[1257,["When you cross this center of Agnya that is","placed in the optic chiasma, you become thoughtlessly"]],[1265,["aware."]],[1266,["You are aware, but there is no thought."]],[1269,["What a blessing it is!"]],[1273,["Say, I see a carpet here, it’s beautiful,","and when I look at it if I start thinking"]],[1280,["“what a good carpet!”"]],[1281,["If it is Mine it’s a very big headache because","I’ll be thinking, “I hope it goes home,"]],[1285,["is already insured, is not lost, is not spoilt”","– all kinds of worries about this carpet."]],[1292,["Thank God it’s not Mine, so I’ll look","at it, still I start thinking how much I should"]],[1298,["pay to get it, from where can I get it; all","these thoughts coming."]],[1303,["But if I look at it without any thoughts,","then the joy of its creation, to whomsoever"]],[1312,["it may belong, so-called, starts pouring on","Me like beautiful flow of joy."]],[1325,["Whatever the artist has put into it, all his","joy starts pouring, that peace and that joyous"]],[1337,["feeling within Me when I don’t think about","it."]],[1342,["Thinking makes a person mad, creates lots","of problems."]],[1347,["Too much thinking is wasteful, also."]],[1350,["As I’ll tell you about the second center","we have here, tomorrow, about the second center,"]],[1358,["that by thinking, how many diseases you get."]],[1362,["The other day I was in a radio station and","the gentleman was asking Me, “How can I"]],[1373,["get rid of my diabetes?"]],[1375,["You say that by thinking it happens.”"]],[1377,["I said, “Yes.”"]],[1380,["Because in India if they have to take tea","in a village, the sugar is put so much that"]],[1388,["the spoon must stand at right angle!"]],[1392,["And nobody gets diabetes."]],[1395,["But people who are sedentary, planning too","much – I mean mostly, say, bureaucrats,"]],[1405,["diplomats, politicians – they are very vulnerable."]],[1411,["What is the reason for that, which I’ll","explain to you tomorrow, how we get all these"]],[1416,["diseases because we think too much and we","cannot stop thinking."]],[1425,["But so far, we have to understand that we","are all on the, either on the right side or"]],[1433,["on the left side."]],[1436,["We are not in the center."]],[1440,["The centers are like this, I would say: the","left and the right, and the left side and"]],[1447,["the right side join together to make the center."]],[1450,["Now supposing you are right-sided – means","you are using too much of your physical or"]],[1455,["mental aptitudes, you are planning for future,","you are very futuristic – then this starts"]],[1464,["extracting energy from this center and starts","moving to the left, right, starts moving to"]],[1471,["the right."]],[1473,["At the same time if something happens on the","left side and you get a jerk, it is broken."]],[1482,["Then you are vulnerable to diseases which","we call as psychosomatic, because this is"]],[1488,["the one is the somatic and this is the psycho."]],[1493,["And these diseases cannot be cured."]],[1500,["Because if somebody’s a doctor then he doesn’t","know about psychology; somebody is psychologist,"]],[1507,["he doesn’t know the medicine."]],[1509,["I mean, we have doctors for one eye and another","doctor for another eye!"]],[1512,["We have gone to that limit of specialization."]],[1516,["This is the science of integration."]],[1524,["Is not a science of specialization but integration,","because this is one body which has got the"]],[1531,["nose, eyes, ears all stuck to one body."]],[1535,["And this is one personality, and we have to","deal with this personality as a whole."]],[1542,["But if you start treating it like one for","the nose, one for the ears, it’s not going"]],[1547,["to work out."]],[1549,["So when this kundalini rises through these","centers it brings them back to normal, to"]],[1557,["the balance, integrates them one with another","and connects them with the mains from where"]],[1567,["the energy flows inside."]],[1571,["And that’s how you become very dynamic,","you don’t get tired, you feel very young,"]],[1578,["you never feel your age; and you are extremely","compassionate and kind, and you love to do"]],[1590,["good to others."]],[1592,["It is so much I have to tell you."]],[1598,["Now Sahaja Yoga is working in forty nations,","and working out very well."]],[1603,["The most surprising place was USSR."]],[1606,["And now the people are saying, “Mother,","You have been working for twenty years in"]],[1611,["the West and only went last year to USSR,","and You have more Sahaja yogis there than"]],[1617,["You have all over the world.”"]],[1619,["Not in India: we have many more, of course,","because they know about it, they were not"]],[1623,["ignorant, so it’s all right – if you forget","India."]],[1626,["I don’t know what’s so special about them","that they could see this so clearly."]],[1635,["And one of the snags of Sahaja Yoga is that","you cannot pay for it."]],[1640,["And this really is the very great snag, I","think, because a gentleman from BBC in England"]],[1648,["told Me that Anglo-Saxon brain cannot understand","anything that can be done without money."]],[1656,["I said, “Who has made this brain, God or","somebody else?”"]],[1659,["It’s very surprising!"]],[1663,["And even in, I went to Toronto – no, Boston","– and they said, “How many Rolls-Royces"]],[1670,["You’ve got?”"]],[1671,["I said, “I have none, because I don’t","take any money."]],[1675,["Whatever I have is of My husband’s.”"]],[1677,["They said, “Then we are not interested."]],[1681,["You have to be in the business.”"]],[1683,["It’s very shocking, this kind of a attitude","towards Divine."]],[1689,["I said, “How much money did you pay to Christ?”"]],[1698,["Today also there was a question from a radio,","and they asked Me, “You don’t take any"]],[1704,["money; then how do You travel?”"]],[1707,["I said, “So far, for quite some time I was","travelling with My husband’s money, no doubt."]],[1714,["But now we have so many Sahaja yogis and they","have some self-respect, and they don’t pay"]],[1719,["Me, they pay to the travel agents, not to","Me."]],[1723,["They don’t want I to pay for them – then","tomorrow will say ‘all right, You pay for"]],[1729,["our food also!’”"]],[1731,["I mean, any self-respecting people can understand","that."]],[1737,["So if somebody does not take money, they go","to that limit that even I should pay for their"]],[1743,["salvation, coming to their place I should","pay for the hall, I should pay for everything."]],[1753,["This kind of a brain – oh, it’s not all,","all of you are not Anglo-Saxon, I hope so!"]],[1761,["– I can’t understand."]],[1765,["And that’s why it has not come up to the","point where it should have."]],[1768,["On the contrary, I must say Russians are very","brave people."]],[1780,["With the war they have become very strong."]],[1786,["On the contrary, in other countries I have","seen with the war they have become very nervous,"]],[1792,["very frightened."]],[1794,["And immediately they took to Sahaja Yoga for","one point, that you cannot pay for it."]],[1799,["They could see it, that you can’t pay because","it’s a living process."]],[1806,["Is such a wisdom that clicked."]],[1809,["You won’t believe, in England I was fighting","with seven hippies for four years: the questions,"]],[1821,["the bombardment and – too much!"]],[1824,["I was about to give up."]],[1829,["They just thought that it’s something to","be attacked."]],[1835,["And that’s the reason they attacked all","the saints, all the incarnations and all the"]],[1840,["prophets."]],[1845,["But I hope now everybody realizes that we","are in trouble."]],[1851,["We are all in trouble."]],[1854,["We don’t know what’s going to happen next","day."]],[1856,["We might get into cancer, might get into some","other trouble."]],[1862,["We might have any problem that we do not know","about."]],[1866,["We are not sure of our future."]],[1870,["So it is better that we get our special energy","that is within us, we get ourselves enlightened"]],[1876,["and take to something that will make us much","wiser, healthier, joyous and knowledgeable."]],[1890,["“Knowledge” does not mean what you know","through your brains, but on your central nervous"]],[1894,["system."]],[1896,["That’s what everybody said, that the time","has come – it’s a blossom time, I call"]],[1907,["it."]],[1908,["There are thousands and thousands who can","get realization."]],[1912,["It’s such a great blessing that we could","have en masse realization."]],[1918,["On the Tree of Life there would have been","only one or two flowers to begin with, but"]],[1923,["today I call it a blossom time."]],[1927,["Is actually the Day of Judgment, but “blossom","time” seems better to say – is more promising."]],[1938,["I hope tonight we all will get realization","and enjoy ourselves."]],[1945,["May God bless you all."]],[1958,["I would like you to ask Me some questions,","because today is a first day. I’m sorry,"]],[1964,["the mike was not all right so they started","very late, they said. The musicians have come"]],[1968,["from India – and you’d be amazed that","Australians, Swiss, Germans, English, all"]],[1980,["of them have learned Sanskrit songs and Marathi","songs, which is such a difficult language,"]],[1989,["all these songs – and they have learnt English","songs. It was impossible to teach an Englishman"]],[1998,["one sentence in Hindi. One gentleman asked","Me, “What do you say to the 'close the door'?”"]],[2009,["So My father told him, “You just say 'there","was a banker.' That means ‘you close the"]],[2016,["door’! And for opening the door you say","'there was a cold day.' That’s how you will"]],[2024,["say 'open the door'!” So it was so difficult,","and I’m amazed how through Sahaja Yoga they"]],[2031,["have become so dynamic."]],[2033,["We have got many artists now flowering out.","In your country itself there are so many artists"]],[2040,["who have come out of Sahaja Yoga. They are","very well known here. Also great potters and"]],[2048,["ceramic makers have come out of this. It’s","working on this part, on this area of creativity,"]],[2059,["and lots of musicians have become great musicians","in India. It’s working out in another direction"]],[2068,["in England, that people are writing books","and they have become good orators who would"]],[2073,["never come on the stage. So this is on a worldly","level, we should say, but they themselves"]],[2081,["are so patient and so loving that the happiest","thing I would like to tell you is that twenty-five"]],[2088,["Germans rushed to USSR, to Russia, to help","Me to give realization to Russians. It was"]],[2099,["very touching, really, to see Germans should","feel that innately that it’s their duty"]],[2107,["to give them realization. They spent their","own money coming down there. It’s rather"]],[2114,["difficult to go to Russia because you have","to pay for the hotels beforehand and all that."]],[2119,["They did all that and they were there. It’s","a beautiful that’s happening in the world,"]],[2126,["very beautiful people. And the way they admire","each other and adore, it’s wonderful."]],[2133,["So I would expect you to ask Me some questions.","But the questions should be relevant because"]],[2139,["I’m not here to aggress you, I’m here","just to give you what you have, your own property."]],[2145,["So there’s no need to be aggressive with","Me or to be angry with Me. I’ve not come"]],[2150,["here to take anything from you. So in a sensible","way, whatever you want to ask please ask,"]],[2157,["and we should not waste also time of other","people who are anxious to have their realization."]],[2164,["[Question: Is Mr. Gorbachev realized?]"]],[2170,["Yes, he is very much. Thank God for that!"]],[2181,["[Question: What about Mr. Bush then?]"]],[2188,["Who?"]],[2190,["[Mr. Bush.]"]],[2192,["You can give him realization. You can."]],[2195,["[Question: What for?]"]],[2201,["It’s better not to ask about that. You see,","even Americans don’t understand sometimes"]],[2214,["that if Gorbachev has opted for democracy","he’s not opted for an American style of"]],[2221,["democracy, because American democracy has","not created very good atmosphere. It’s a,"]],[2227,["if you go to America you can’t even wear","a wedding ring. They can kill you even for"]],[2233,["a wedding ring. Such a situation is there.","Horrible!"]],[2237,["And I was going once on a Los Angeles road","and the one who was driving Me told Me that"]],[2243,["“Mother, put down Your head.”"]],[2244,["I said, “Why?”"]],[2245,["And he said, “On this road last week eleven","people were killed.”"]],[2248,["I said, “Why?”"]],[2249,["“For the heck of it.”"]],[2251,["I said, “For the heck of it? So mad?”"]],[2258,["So that democracy has not created a good society,","not good society. They have money, that’s"]],[2266,["all. But money is also not so much well-balanced,","I would say; it doesn’t create good people,"]],[2276,["good children, good families. It should be","the money which is auspicious, which should"]],[2284,["create good atmosphere. And very sick people","there are: certain are very silly also, stupid."]],[2295,["Like eighty-two-year-old people, cinema actors","and actresses, going for a shake dance – they’re"]],[2305,["already shaking! I mean, this I can’t understand.","And they, they want to ride horses at the"]],[2321,["age of ninety-two years of age. And then they","fall down and die. What is the need at ninety-two"]],[2327,["to ride a horse? I mean, there’s no maturity.","If democracy cannot mature you, then it’s"]],[2336,["not nourishing. It must mature; you must become","a wiser person. If you still remain a sixteen-year-old"]],[2345,["brat, what’s the use?"]],[2354,["So it has failed somewhere. As communism has","failed, it has also failed. But Gorbachev"]],[2362,["could see. Mr. Bush has to also see that.","Also the way they are supporting these Azerbaijanis"]],[2370,["– they’re horrible people, these Azerbaijani.","I’ve been there, I’ve been to Samarkand"]],[2375,["and I’ve been to all these places, and they","were rolling in luxuries, rolling in luxuries"]],[2380,["when I went there, thousand time better than","their neighbors Afghanis."]],[2385,["But they said, “We are very miserable because","we can’t follow Islam.”"]],[2391,["But I said, “Why do you want to follow Islam?","What Islam has done good or Christianity has"]],[2396,["done good? Why are you so much anxious to","follow Islam?”"]],[2400,["“No, we must have.”"]],[2402,["And now the Iranians are penetrating that,","and if you support these Azerbaijanis you"]],[2406,["are supporting the Iranians and their fundamentalism.","So there’s no thought given to it. It’s"]],[2414,["not a proper vision; it’s a very blurred","vision. One should see clearly what we are"]],[2422,["doing, who are we helping. There should be","some principle in what we are doing. Imagine,"]],[2433,["Abraham Lincoln who started, who was a realized","soul himself, and how far you have taken him"]],[2442,["there? And there’s only one single road","somewhere in his name. I mean, nobody bothers"]],[2449,["about the principles he established. So something","has gone wrong there. So we must sit back"]],[2455,["and see that what’s wrong with our democracy.","And in all these democratic countries all"]],[2470,["kinds of false gurus have prospered, because","everybody has freedom to give the money to"]],[2476,["whosoever they like."]],[2478,["Yes? These two ladies …. All right, you","ask first."]],[2490,["[Question: She’s been doing yoga for fifteen","years. And she says she has reached all these"]],[2511,["points that You have mentioned, but she is","weak on her left side. Can You help her?]"]],[2519,["Yah. It’s just the outcome of the modern","yoga, absolutely. Actually, Patanjali has"]],[2530,["written such a big book on Hatha Yoga. Nobody","reads that. Only they have taken a wee, wee,"]],[2538,["wee part of it, which is ashtanga, means there","are eight portions out of which one portion"]],[2547,["is yam niyam, out of which it’s one-eighth","of the portion is about exercise, the physical."]],[2557,["But that also is to be used when your kundalini","is rising and you see the defects in your"]],[2566,["spinal cord, or anywhere in your chakras:","then you must know if there is any need for"]],[2574,["a physical correction – all right? But the","way we are doing now Hatha Yoga is like taking"]],[2582,["all the medicines of the medicine box inside,","without any discrimination. So when we pay"]],[2589,["so much attention to the physical side, we","go to the right side and left side is neglected."]],[2594,["There’s an imbalance. And you develop lots","of physical troubles also – physical. Like"]],[2601,["these days jogging is a fashion, so everybody’s","jogging. Everybody wants to be a cinema actress,"]],[2607,["or might be a beauty competition – I don’t","know what they want. And they don’t understand"]],[2614,["that we are human beings, we are delicately","made. Even old people of eighty years are"]],[2620,["jogging, for what? And then they get heart","attacks, serious troubles."]],[2628,["So this kind of a Hatha Yoga weakens your","left side to such an extent that a woman may"]],[2635,["not be able to produce a child, even. Apart","from that, a man who does Hatha Yoga of this"]],[2642,["kind is such a hot-tempered fellow, like an","oven, that you’d better approach that person"]],[2647,["with a barge-pole! God knows when he’ll","jump on you. But in Sahaja Yoga you’ll achieve"]],[2655,["your balance. So don’t, not to do so many","exercises now, discriminately understanding"]],[2662,["which one you want, you have to do – that","much you should do."]],[2668,["Yes. Then there’s one lady here who raised","the hand."]],[2678,["[Question: How can you tell whether you are","acting from intuition or if it's just the"]],[2691,["desire of the moment?]"]],[2694,["You mean you are asking Me or about yourself?"]],[2698,["[Question: In a general sense. How can you","tell the difference?]"]],[2705,["Because you have not reached that state of","Self-realization. In Self-realization if you"]],[2716,["ask a question, any question: say, somebody","says, “I don’t believe in God.” All"]],[2722,["right, ask a question, “Is there God?”","three times, and you get a beautiful wind"]],[2731,["coming on you. “Was Christ the Son of God?”","Ask this question: you get it. Then ask about"]],[2742,["some horrid guru who has been lynching you,","and you will get burns, might get even blisters."]],[2751,["But unless and until you are a realized soul,","you have to – it’s not easy to make it"]],[2757,["out. The only thing, you have to be connected","first of all and to be established. Then you"]],[2765,["reach a state of doubtless awareness, from","the thoughtless awareness. And then you become"]],[2771,["tremendous."]],[2771,["[Sahaja yogi: There’s one right at the back.]"]],[2778,["Anyone."]],[2784,["[Question: Does your realization take place","instantly or does it take place gradually?]"]],[2801,["It takes instantly, My child. It should. Most","of the cases it has to; it’s so spontaneous."]],[2811,["There was a saint called Ramadasa who was","the guru of Shivaji, a great king in India"]],[2816,["– a realized soul, again – and somebody","asked that saint, “How much time does it"]],[2822,["take for the kundalini to rise?”"]],[2825,["And in Sanskrit he said, “Tatkshan” – means","“that moment.” That moment. But there"]],[2830,["has to be the person who gives you realization","authorized by the Divine, and the one who"]],[2839,["is a seeker of truth. I mean, I’m Myself","surprised the way it's happening today, everywhere."]],[2849,["These days it’s really very surprising that","the Divine is so anxious to give you realization."]],[2856,["Many people ask Me, “Mother, why do You","give realization to so many people?”"]],[2861,["I said, “How can I limit it? Now it has","become limitless.”"]],[2865,["Some, like the parable of Christ, fall in","the marshy land and just sprouted and lost"]],[2875,["– I know that. But they’ll come back;","I’m sure they’ll come back. But some do"]],[2883,["prosper very fast and settle down. Imagine","in a place like Russia, I thought this must"]],[2890,["be just wilderness, there I find beautiful","things happening. They, they never talked"]],[2895,["of God, they never talked of religion, they","never talked of spirituality. And openly I"]],[2905,["talked of God and everything; nobody arrested","Me there. Here, we who worship God and who"]],[2915,["have so many churches, who have so many temples","and mosques and all that, you have – I have"]],[2921,["to move like a criminal! Except for their","church or their mosque or their temples, you"]],[2930,["are a cult; while they take all the money,","everything – they are very money-oriented"]],[2935,["and power-oriented also – but you are a","cult! Is very funny."]],[2944,["Yes, please? There’s still the another gentleman","also? …. All right. They need to ask Me"]],[2951,["…."]],[2951,["[Question: Mother, I’ve been trying for","about two months, but I don’t feel any cool"]],[2957,["breeze up here.]"]],[2958,["You feel it in your hands?"]],[2965,["[No, I don’t.]"]],[2967,["All right, we’ll see about it. After the","program – ah, definitely today you’ll"]],[2972,["feel it."]],[2976,["[Question: Where in the seven centers would","You place instinct?]"]],[2985,["You see, “instinct” is a very confusing","word – all right? In the seventh center"]],[2993,["when you arrive, you arrive in the limbic","area. And limbic area has got the seven seats"]],[3000,["of seven centers. So you cannot say that any","particular place is the instinct, but the"]],[3011,["instinct comes from the Divine. So when it","is connected with the Divine, you receive"]],[3021,["it in your brain and it’s transmitted to","your nerves. Also it is transmitted to your"]],[3033,["centers, nourishing it. So you cannot categorize","it."]],[3044,["Yes, what is it? Ask, ask!"]],[3055,["[Question: He finds it very confusing: what","is mind, what is a thought and what is thinking?]"]],[3072,["I think tomorrow I’m going to talk about","thinking. In that I’ll tell you everything"]],[3076,["– all right? Can you keep it for tomorrow,","please? All right? Tomorrow I’ll tell you."]],[3082,["[Question: Got food anything to do with this","process or technique?]"]],[3088,["You see, any kind of food that you eat has","to be suitable for your temperament, your"]],[3094,["prakriti. It has to be suitable. Supposing","you are a very right-sided person, then it’s"]],[3099,["better for you to take more to carbohydrates.","But supposing you are a left-sided person,"]],[3105,["is better for you to take to proteins. There’s","no hard and fast rule about it. It has to"]],[3111,["be complementary to your nature. That’s","how we decide. Every individual has a different"]],[3119,["temperament, and accordingly we have to decide","what sort of food one should take. … May"]],[3131,["God bless."]],[3134,["[Question: Two questions, Shri Mother. One,","are You a vegetarian? And secondly, does the"]],[3145,["soul have a memory?]"]],[3149,["All right. About Me you’d better discover.","You see, I don’t talk about Myself. The"]],[3156,["reason is this: anybody who tried to seek,","say anything about oneself or claim anything,"]],[3164,["people have been very nasty. Christ said,","“I am the Son of God” – which is a fact."]],[3175,["They crucified Him. He didn’t tell a lie.","So I’m very tactful! So you first get your"]],[3187,["realization, because I don’t want to get","crucified just now; I want to postpone it"]],[3193,["as much as possible! So about Me you can find","out, once you get your realization, is better."]],[3202,["What is the second?"]],[3206,["[Question: Does the soul have a memory?]"]],[3210,["Soul has a memory, of course it has. Soul","also is another subject which will take at"]],[3215,["least three, four lectures, and I have given","lectures on that. You can take the tape and"]],[3222,["see for yourself, and after realization you","can see those dead souls also and also you"]],[3229,["can see the Chaitanya, these vibrations, as","small little commas shining. After realization"]],[3237,["you see them. And now there are lots of discoveries","have been made which I’ve said about soul,"]],[3242,["which you can also see from My tapes and can","hear about it. It’s a very long subject."]],[3273,["All right?"]],[3279,["[Question: He has some artificial heart valves","and things in his body, and he wonders if"]],[3292,["a person who has artificial organs can obtain","Self-realization.]"]],[3296,["Of course, you can. Anybody who is living","can get realization. Because, you are living"]],[3306,["because there is spirit within you. The day","spirit disappears from your heart, we are"]],[3319,["no more. On the contrary, your heart condition","will improve, very much. Many people who had"]],[3328,["bypass got rid of it. Many people who had","angina got completely cured. Many heart patients"]],[3337,["were cured completely."]],[3339,["Yes, now, you ask. Now she is asking. … Can","you hear her? Little loudly, can you?"]],[3359,["[Question: Apparently the authors of a lot","of these chakra books say that each chakra"]],[3380,["corresponds to a different …]"]],[3384,["Areas."]],[3384,["[Question continues: ... corroboration of","your soul, of your being. Is that actually"]],[3385,["true? Like as in the chakra here – ]"]],[3386,["Agnya."]],[3387,["[Question continues: Yeah. If, they say that","if that’s opened, you are able to perceive"]],[3394,["things in other beings; like you’re able","to see where they have been and … or you"]],[3395,["are able to use psychic powers and things,","you know? Is that actually true?]"]],[3396,["Yah. Now, this chakra is very important … This","chakra of Agnya which is on the optic chiasma"]],[3400,["is a very important center. It is a very constricted","thing, and the resurrection of Christ has"]],[3410,["solved the problem for us, because He was","resurrected and He's bestowed upon on this"]],[3417,["chakra. He’s the ruling deity of this chakra.","So when kundalini awakens Him on this chakra,"]],[3426,["He sucks in these two balloons, as I told","you: ego and superego. Now the ego and superego"]],[3436,["are controlled by two organs or two things,","what we call as the pituitary and the pineal."]],[3446,["So this center controls pituitary and the","pineal part. Also it is on the optic chiasma."]],[3452,["So you can see things clearly through it.","When it is awakened, you start seeing subtler"]],[3463,["things. But if you see the light, then it’s","not correct. That means you have moved to"]],[3469,["the right, because you see elements on the","right side. You may see also the past: you"]],[3474,["may, you may see Krishna; you may see somebody,","the past. What you have to see, whatever you"]],[3485,["see, you are not that. Supposing I see the","light, I am not the light. So you have to"]],[3490,["be the light. So this movement is deviation","from reality. Either to the right, to the"]],[3498,["left, is not correct and should not be considered","as some achievement, because seeing gives"]],[3506,["you nothing. Being gives you. It is becoming;","you have to become. All right? Now, is there?"]],[3528,["[Question: Are our actions governed by free","will, or is it just fate?]"]],[3535,["It’s free will, absolute free will. You","have come here with your free will, and I"]],[3544,["respect your free will, your freedom. If you","don’t want to have Self-realization, it"]],[3552,["cannot be forced, it cannot be done. It respects","your free will. You can only get it if you"]],[3562,["in free will, in your free glory, you want","to have it. In a way, of course, it does help"]],[3573,["people who live in moderation; but as I told","you, the Divine is so anxious that whatever"]],[3582,["you might have been, you get your realization,","sort of a thing happening today. That’s"]],[3587,["what I’ve seen it. So that’s what you","should expect, and shouldn’t think of your"]],[3595,["past at all. Forget it. Yes?"]],[3599,["[Question: What then of karma?]"]],[3600,["Karma, as I told you, is sucked in when the","kundalini rises through this center. She’s"]],[3608,["sucked in those two institutions. One of them","is of ego. Is the only ego tells us we are"]],[3615,["doing karmas. Animals don’t feel they are","committing sins or doing karmas; only we,"]],[3619,["because we have ego. This ego is sucked in.","So all our karmas are finished. They said"]],[3625,["Christ has died for our sins, and that is","proved. … So far …"]],[3644,["[Question: In regard to reincarnation, do","humans come back as humans?]"]],[3661,["Yes, they do. Some of them do come from animal","stage also, because that we can explain why"]],[3668,["they behave like this!"]],[3670,["[Question: Mother, I’ve been getting very","powerful sensations on this finger here and"]],[3684,["this area here. What is the cause of that","disturbance …?]"]],[3688,["What is the feeling? In the Agnya, here? Here","and here. You are feeling heat?"]],[3693,["[Pain on top of that finger and a small, a","kind of heat and pain there …]"]],[3702,["Here? All right. You don’t worry about the","cause. We’ll correct it. All right? It’s,"]],[3714,["it’s better not to know about it. It’s","nothing serious but still … You see, this"]],[3718,["may be that – what is your job?"]],[3721,["[I don’t have a job. I was in an auto accident","last year and I’ve been incapacitated since.]"]],[3730,["Incapacitated?"]],[3730,["[Yes.]"]],[3730,["How?"]],[3731,["[Injuries to both legs and right up to my","abdomen, right up to my chest.]"]],[3740,["What he said?"]],[3740,["[Sahaja yogi: He's had severe injuries to","both legs and his torso up to his chest.]"]],[3741,["And on your left hand, what are you feeling?"]],[3741,["[A lot of pain in that finger there and a","pain just here which is in line with the third"]],[3746,["finger.]"]],[3746,["All of them?"]],[3746,["[Sahaja yogi: The right Vishuddhi, Shri Mother","…]"]],[3753,["[And this one here.]"]],[3760,["All right. So this is, this is definitely","connected with your body and that has to be"]],[3769,["corrected, that’s all. All right? Then you","won’t feel anything."]],[3775,["[Question: Why do we take on the physical","state?]"]],[3786,["You cannot get realization without it, My","child. You cannot get","it in the air!"]],[3806,["[Question: He said, if realization is the","dropping away of habits, isn’t riding a"]],[3826,["horse at ninety-five just a matter of habit?]"]],[3829,["No, no, no, no, no! You didn’t understand.","No, what happens, you become a very powerful"]],[3836,["personality. And you become an enlightened","personality. So you drop out whatever is bad"]],[3842,["for you, that’s all."]],[3845,["[Question: Is horse-riding necessarily bad?]"]],[3849,["Anything that is not good for you, you understand","and nobody has to tell you. You become your"]],[3854,["own master, you become your own guru and you","drop it. I don’t have to tell you “don’t"]],[3859,["do this” or “don’t do that” – you","just do it yourself. Isn’t it better for"]],[3863,["Me? (Now, so many questions; it’s ten o’clock","about, yes?)"]],[3876,["[Unclear question]"]],[3879,["What did he say? Did you follow him?"]],[3887,["[Sahaja yogi: I don’t think I got that one.","…. I think he said, if You promote the idea"]],[3918,["of jumping into the divine flow of vibrations","and want to clear ourselves, once upon a time"]],[3925,["we jumped into the river to get clean but","now the river is polluted. Are there dangers"]],[3930,["in jumping into the spirit?]"]],[3933,["No, no, not at all dangerous – it’s wonderful!","No, no, not at all dangerous: that’s a myth."]],[3942,["That’s a myth about kundalini. It’s such","a myth they have created because they never"]],[3947,["wanted you to get your realization, so that","they could make money out of you, you see."]],[3952,["They don’t want you to go to reality. So","then, they can use you. That’s the reason"]],[3957,["they said all these things. It has no meaning.","We have now been working in so many places,"]],[3961,["I’ve never seen. At the most some people,","like this lady who was here was sick, was"]],[3968,["shaking her hand, and then she put it to her","Mother Earth and she was sitting before Me,"]],[3974,["and she got all right. So her shaking stopped.","It was Parkinson’s. Just sitting here; she’s"]],[3980,["gone now."]],[3980,["[Question: What is the flame, Shri Mother","‒ the spirit? What is the flame? …. On"]],[3980,["the chart.]"]],[3985,["Where is the flame?"]],[3993,["[Sahaja yogi: On the left Heart.]"]],[4000,["On the left Heart is the spirit. Is the spirit.","It’s difficult to show spirit, you see,"]],[4010,["so they have shown it as a flame."]],[4020,["[Question: Do dreams have a part in one's","spirit?]"]],[4028,["They come from different areas. They don’t","only come from collective subconscious, they"]],[4034,["come also from the subconscious that you have","had in past lives, maybe in this life; could"]],[4040,["be from just from yesterday. So it depends","on from what area it comes. But it’s not"]],[4047,["important. Once you know the real truth, then","you don’t bother about these things; because"]],[4051,["the communication is not circuitous, it’s","just direct, so you know the truth. So you’re"]],[4057,["not interested to know any more."]],[4061,["[Question: Is there","a place for sorrow in someone who is self-realized?]"]],[4076,["No, no, not at all. It’s such a joy. You","see, sorrow comes through our ignorance. Also"]],[4088,["they want to, you to feel sorry for everything,","you know. Like the way they show Christ like"]],[4094,["a skeleton, you see, naturally you feel sorry;","but only Michelangelo could see clearly that"]],[4102,["it was a great Personality. So he painted","Him like a great giant in the, you see Him"]],[4110,["in the Sistine Chapel. But below on the table","they have placed a skeleton of Christ which"]],[4119,["is, creates such horrible feelings within","yourself. I think we should ask one of these"]],[4126,["priests to carry one, the cross across and","see if they can do it with their skeleton"]],[4133,["bodies."]],[4133,["So sorrow is also created. Also, people like","to show they are sorry. Like this Greek tragedy"]],[4143,["has no sense in it; just make it Greek tragedy,","unnecessarily. I mean, one gentleman falls"]],[4154,["in love: he falls, doesn’t rise, falls in","love! And then he doesn’t marry that person;"]],[4162,["then he is pining. I mean, human life is worth","much more, not to pine after one lady. Then"]],[4171,["in next year he marries that lady. I mean","this is the – you see, everything must have"]],[4177,["an antithesis also. So then he marries the","same lady, and then he wants to get rid of"]],[4183,["her somehow. And then he murders her out of","frustration. This should be the story, because"]],[4190,["this kind of wasteful habits of human beings","leading nowhere. You cannot get joy from another"]],[4198,["person: joy is your own property. This comes","from your own spirit. It doesn’t depend"]],[4206,["on another person. Only a realized soul can","enjoy another realized soul. Only you understand"]],[4216,["the value of another person when you are a","realized soul, and another person is also"]],[4221,["a realized soul; otherwise you cannot. Yes?"]],[4227,["[Unclear question]"]],[4231,["You see, Gorbachev has solved one problem,","a little bit. Because these are two superior"]],[4249,["powers, you see: super-most, we can call,","superpowers. So the, you need two hands to"]],[4256,["clap. So one hand has receded. Now this hand","doesn’t know what to do, what to hit, so"]],[4262,["it has to recede also. So in a way, the pressure","of war he has lessened, and he is going to"]],[4271,["lessen more. But I think today the world problem","is, if you see internationally, is fundamentalism."]],[4281,["Is fundamentalism. And those who try to encourage","fundamentalism are really committing sins"]],[4287,["against humanity, I think. So fundamentalism","I find as the biggest problem, and to answer"]],[4295,["to this is Sahaja Yoga."]],[4297,["Then our social problems come because we don’t","understand the role of a woman and the role"]],[4301,["of a man; and when we don’t respect women","for their great role they are playing, they"]],[4307,["become something funny. So all this understanding","comes to you very beautifully when you become"]],[4314,["a self-realized person. Another problem is","ecological problem, comes out of our own imbalances."]],[4322,["Whatever is inside, we manifest outside. You","see, there’s so much imbalance in us."]],[4329,["Like in, when we were in India I never allowed","any drinks in My house. I said, “All right,"]],[4336,["if you want to drink, drink in your house","and come to My house.” But I can’t understand"]],[4341,["a person who is drunk. God knows, he might","just get up and slap Me or do anything! But"]],[4349,["when we went to London, they, they said we","have to offer them. I said, “All right.”"]],[4355,["I told My husband, “You arrange all that.","Do it yourself.” That time ‒ it’s long"]],[4360,["time back I’m telling you ‒ just to buy","crystal tumblers for an ordinary party we"]],[4369,["had to shell out nine hundred pounds, to begin","with. That’s the beginning of the library."]],[4379,["And so many were to be added later on. There","is one cup for this and a one cup for that"]],[4384,["– I mean, a one cup is sufficient. And one","tumbler for that and this – big, it’s"]],[4394,["a big science, you know ‒ books after books.","I told My husband, “You’d better get it"]],[4402,["and read it.” Then we hired three, four","people. I said, “Baba, you look after these"]],[4408,["people.” Somebody wants this, somebody wants","that, and it’s a very big sort of a social"]],[4414,["nonsensical wastage."]],[4415,["So these things we have created. Then, fork","and spoon, you start from here, go on like"]],[4425,["that; and then go on that way. There’s no","need to do all that. And I understand, if"]],[4434,["it was something artistic, all right, some","artists are doing. But these days there’s"]],[4439,["no art: it’s so simple, there’s no art","in it. If there’s even one flower they don’t"]],[4444,["like it – this is too much. No art anywhere,","no Limoges, it’s just straightforward march."]],[4453,["So all this creation is all useless rubbish","which will form another plastic mountain."]],[4462,["So this ecological problem has come because","we have no sense of balance and discretion."]],[4469,["Just go to the shopping: the husband gives","the money to the wife to buy some shirts and"]],[4473,["she comes out with some three, four funny","punk dresses which will be discarded after"]],[4483,["three, four months. We play into the hands","of entrepreneurs all the time. Entrepreneurs"]],[4489,["start some sort of a funny dress: all right,","everybody must dress up like that. We have"]],[4494,["our own intelligence, we have our own personality!","We have no individuality left; everybody must"]],[4500,["dress up the same way."]],[4501,["Now, I should say that we must put some oil","in our head at least the day we want to wash"]],[4508,["our hair, because we’ll all become bald","and then these entrepreneurs will sell us"]],[4515,["the wigs. That’s the trick! So now the fashion","is not to put oil – all right, don’t put"]],[4521,["oil; but at least before washing your hair","you can put some oil in your head. You see,"]],[4527,["this is what I am saying: the wisdom part","is not there and the balance is not there,"]],[4531,["and because of that we are getting into trouble.","All kinds of venturesome things have started,"]],[4539,["like the Grand Prix. Now, the man must die","in the Grand Prix, otherwise it’s not a"]],[4546,["good one – that’s what they say, exactly."]],[4550,["So this sensationalisation – must have sensations,","as if we have become numbed people: absolutely"]],[4555,["we have no sensitivity to feel any joy or","happiness, so we have to be given injections"]],[4560,["all the time, like electric shocks. To Me","all these things, this looks so shocking."]],[4567,["And I’ll tell you tomorrow what happens","to you when you get into all these shocks."]],[4571,["This is what happens, that you develop blood","cancer. Cancer is created by us, by our imbalance,"]],[4581,["by our insanity. We have to become sane people.","We must respect ourselves. Perhaps we have"]],[4591,["had no identity so far, that’s why we are","like this. But once you are realized, you"]],[4596,["know your identity and then you enjoy yourself,","you respect yourself. And don’t waste your"]],[4605,["time in useless things, destroying yourself."]],[4608,["Yes? I, I tell you now, you see, the time","is coming up much more, so one question will"]],[4617,["do. Now who will withdraw? …. All right,","one lady waiting. Who is that one? This one?"]],[4640,["…. What is it? …. What?"]],[4642,["[Question: The spirit. Does the spirit discriminate","between good and evil, love and hate, or does"]],[4652,["it just react?]"]],[4653,["Spirit is the source of knowledge, absolute","knowledge; is the source of peace, is the"]],[4666,["source of wisdom, is the source of joy, is","the source that enlightens our attention."]],[4681,["We have such a big property with us. We should","allow it to enlighten us, shouldn’t we?"]],[4691,["Now I think we should stop the questions,","because there’s one thing: I’m quite good"]],[4698,["at answering questions. I’ll answer all","your questions, but by that I cannot guarantee"]],[4708,["your realization. I can answer most of your","questions, but I can’t guarantee your realization."]],[4714,["Realization has to work out. So even if you","have not been able to ask some question, forget"]],[4720,["it. You can bring them tomorrow written down,","and I would like to answer them when you come"]],[4728,["tomorrow. Beforehand if you give, I’ll answer","them. But just now I think, tell your mind"]],[4733,["not to bother you any more about questions.","And that’s why I wanted you to ask questions,"]],[4737,["so that your mind should not suddenly come","out like jack-in-the-box and say, “Oh, you"]],[4742,["didn’t ask this question. How can you have","realization?” So the most important thing"]],[4750,["is to get your realization."]],[4755,["So I think, let us have it now. Again, I cannot","force on you. You have to have it in your"]],[4763,["free will. So please, those who want to have","should be there. It will take hardly ten minutes"]],[4771,["to work it out, and then tomorrow again I’m","going to work it out. It’s very simple,"]],[4780,["very easy. But those who don’t want to have","it should not be in the hall. It’s not proper,"]],[4786,["it’s not civil. So all those who want to","have it, are welcome."]],[4792,["At the very outset, at the very outset there","are two conditions I have to tell you. First"]],[4811,["one, as I told you before also, you have to","forget the past. You have to forgive yourself,"]],[4820,["and know that you are not guilty at all. All","these ideas are given to you that you are"]],[4827,["sinful, you are guilty, you are this and that","because they wanted to cash it. You don’t"]],[4836,["have to suffer either. So first of all you","should know that you must forgive yourself"]],[4846,["and must have self-esteem and you should be","very pleasantly placed towards yourself, because"]],[4852,["you are going to enter into the Kingdom of","God. This is the first condition."]],[4861,["Now the second condition is that you have","to forgive everyone. Some will say it’s"]],[4870,["very difficult to forgive. But whether you","forgive or don’t forgive, you don’t do"]],[4878,["anything. It’s a myth. But if you don’t","forgive then you really play into the hands"]],[4885,["of the people who want to torture you. So","best is to forgive them, forget about them."]],[4890,["Forgive and forget. But don’t start counting","how many people I have to forgive, what mistakes"]],[4896,["they have done – nothing of the kind. Just","in general say “I forgive everyone” – just,"]],[4902,["and it’s done. Because Divine is the ocean","of forgiveness, it’s a very powerful ocean"]],[4908,["of forgiveness, and you cannot do anything","that it cannot forgive. And once you say “I"]],[4915,["forgive,” Divine takes over; we don’t","have to bother. All right? These are the two"]],[4924,["conditions we have; very simple conditions,","I think. We have to take out our shoes to"]],[4930,["take the help of the Mother Earth. That’s","very important."]],[4943,["(It’s supposed to be .… Too much for the","throat, talking all the time. All right.)"]],[4980,["Now …. (It’s all right.) You have to put","both your feet apart from each other, because"]],[4989,["as I told you there are two powers. A little","apart from each other, not touching. And you"]],[4994,["have to be comfortable. If there’s something","tight you can release it a little bit. You"]],[5000,["need not bend down or stretch yourself too","much. Just in a normal way you sit down. Put"]],[5007,["no strain on your body. You have to put your","left hand towards Me like this, in a comfortable"]],[5016,["way, on your – you can keep it on your lap,","whatever is comfortable. Now this represents"]],[5025,["that you desire to have your realization.","So you keep it all the time like this. And"]],[5031,["with the right hand we’ll nourish our centers.","With the right hand we will nourish our centers."]],[5040,["And so you will know also how to raise your","kundalini yourself. So two things can be done:"]],[5046,["your kundalini will be raised; as well as","you will feel, you will know how to feel your"]],[5055,["centers within yourself and how to correct","them. We’ll be working only on the left-hand"]],[5061,["side. So now you have to put the left hand","towards Me. First I’ll show you, he will"]],[5069,["show you what is to be done, and then you’ll","have to close your eyes later on."]],[5080,["First we’ll put our hand on our heart. In","the heart resides the spirit. Then we’ll"]],[5095,["have to put our hand on the upper portion","of our abdomen, on the left-hand side. This"]],[5104,["is the center of your mastery, created by","great masters. Then you have to take your"]],[5113,["right hand in the lower portion of your abdomen","on the left-hand side, which is a very important"]],[5118,["center which manifests this pure knowledge","on your central nervous system. Then you have"]],[5135,["to raise your hand higher, again on to the","left side of your abdomen, on the upper part."]],[5144,["Press it hard, on the center of mastery. Then","to your heart again. And then on to the corner"]],[5159,["between your neck and your shoulder – from","the front side, not from the back but from"]],[5164,["the front side – and turn your head to your","right. Now this center is very important,"]],[5170,["because this catches on very much, specially","in the West, because people all the time feel"]],[5177,["guilty. And because of this people get spondylitis","and angina and all other lethargic organs"]],[5185,["diseases. So please put your hand here, as","far back as possible, and turn your head to"]],[5194,["your right."]],[5195,["Now, take your right hand and put it on your","forehead across and try to put your head down"]],[5206,["slowly, resting on this hand. And now press","it on both the sides, as we do it when we"]],[5219,["have headache. This is the center for forgiving","others. Then you have to take down your hand,"]],[5228,["take up your hand onto the back side of your","head where the optic lobe is, here at the"]],[5233,["back. And now turn your head upward as far","as possible, resting on your hand. This is"]],[5243,["the center where you have to ask for forgiveness","from the Divine without feeling guilty – is"]],[5249,["for your satisfaction. Now, stretch your hand,","stretch your palm and put the center of your"]],[5258,["palm just on top of the fontanel bone area,","which was the soft bone in your childhood."]],[5267,["And now bend your head, please, downward as","much as possible. Push back your fingers,"]],[5277,["push back as much as possible. Now there will","be a pressure on the scalp. Now move this"]],[5285,["pressure on the scalp slowly clockwise, seven","times. You have to move the scalp, not your"]],[5292,["hand so much as the scalp, seven times clockwise,","slowly. Bend your head."]],[5302,["That’s what we’ll have to do. That’s","all, nothing more. That’s the only thing"]],[5315,["we have to do. Now, you can take out your","spectacles if you want because you’re closing"]],[5322,["your eyes, and might help your eyesight also."]],[5328,["Now, put your left hand towards Me, comfortably.","Put your feet apart from each other. And now"]],[5338,["put your right hand on your heart and close","your eyes. Here you have to ask Me a very"]],[5354,["important question, in your heart. You ask","Me a question as you would ask a computer."]],[5361,["You can call Me “Shri Mataji” or “Mother”,","whatever you like. “Mother, am I the spirit?”"]],[5371,["Ask the question, in your heart, not loudly.","Three times ask in your heart, not loudly,"]],[5377,["“Mother, am I the spirit?” You have to","only ask in your heart."]],[5394,["If you are the spirit you become your own","guide, you become your own master, you become"]],[5400,["your own guru. So now take down your right","hand into the upper portion of your abdomen"]],[5410,["on the left-hand side. And here you have to","ask another question, three times, not loudly,"]],[5424,["in your heart, “Mother, am I the spirit?”","– ah! “Mother, am I my own master? Mother,"]],[5432,["am I my own master?” Ask this question three","times. “Am I my own master?”"]],[5457,["I have told you that I respect your freedom,","and the pure knowledge cannot be forced on"]],[5470,["you. So please take your right hand in the","lower portion of your abdomen, and say it"]],[5482,["six times, asking Me, “Mother, please give","me pure knowledge.” I cannot force on you."]],[5492,["You have to ask in your free will."]],[5502,["As soon as you ask for the pure knowledge,","the kundalini starts moving upward."]],[5522,["So now we have to nourish the higher centers","with our self-confidence. Raise your right"]],[5536,["hand in the upper portion of your abdomen.","Press it hard, on the left-hand side. And"]],[5549,["here with full confidence you have to say","ten times, in your heart, not loudly, “Mother,"]],[5558,["I am my own master.” Please say this ten","times, “Mother, I am my own master.”"]],[5587,["I told you at the very outset that the greatest","truth about you is that you are not this body,"]],[5594,["you are not this mind, you are not these conditionings,","emotions, nor this ego, but you are the spirit."]],[5604,["You are the pure spirit. So now raise your","right hand onto your heart and ask here, or"]],[5625,["say with full confidence, twelve times, “Mother,","I am the spirit.” Just say it without any"]],[5637,["hesitation. Say it twelve times, please."]],[5654,["For your information you have to know that","the divine Power is the source of knowledge,"]],[5671,["is the ocean of knowledge, is the ocean of","love. It is the ocean of peace and ocean of"]],[5685,["bliss. But above all it is the ocean of forgiveness.","So you cannot commit any mistake which cannot"]],[5694,["be dissolved by the power of this ocean of","forgiveness. So please raise your right hand"]],[5702,["in the corner of your neck, on your shoulder,","push it back as much as possible and turn"]],[5711,["your head to your right, and with full confidence","please say sixteen times, full confidence,"]],[5722,["in your heart, “Mother, I am not guilty","at all.”"]],[5740,["All right. As I told you before that you have","to forgive everyone, and those who say it"]],[5758,["is difficult, they must know that it is a","myth whether you forgive or don’t forgive."]],[5764,["But if you don’t forgive then you play into","the wrong hands and get yourself tortured"]],[5771,["by yourself. So please forgive – in general,","everyone, not counting how many people you"]],[5778,["have to forgive, what you have to forgive","– but just say, by raising your hand and"]],[5783,["putting it on top of your forehead across,","putting down your head as much as possible,"]],[5792,["resting on your hand. Please say, with an","open heart please say, “Mother, I forgive"]],[5806,["everyone.” Please say it, please say; otherwise","it is difficult later on for Me: I have to"]],[5820,["clear out everybody’s Agnya and this takes","too much time then. So best is to say it from"]],[5826,["your heart. After all, you are not going to","miss your Self-realization for that."]],[5836,["Now take back your right hand on the back","side of your head, and put your head on it,"]],[5847,["resting on it, upward. Here you have to say","for your own satisfaction, “Oh Divine, if"]],[5858,["I have done any mistakes, please forgive me.”","But don’t feel guilty, don’t count your"]],[5864,["mistakes, don’t think about them. In general","you have to say, “Oh Divine, please forgive"]],[5869,["me if I have done any mistakes or anything","wrong, anything against You.”"]],[5881,["Now, stretch your palm, stretch your palm","and put the center of your palm on top of"]],[5890,["the fontanel bone area which was a soft bone","in your childhood. Now put down your head"]],[5898,["properly. And here push back your fingers","as far as possible. Please push back. This"]],[5909,["is very important. And now put a pressure","on your scalp, and move your scalp slowly"]],[5916,["seven times clockwise. Here again I respect","your freedom, and I cannot force Self-realization"]],[5926,["on you. So here you have to say seven times,","bending your head properly and pressing it"]],[5934,["hard, moving seven times, “Mother, please","give me my Self-realization.” Please ask"]],[5941,["seven times, please."]],[5943,["[Shri Mataji blows into the microphone.]"]],[5971,["Now, take down your hands and put them towards","Me, little higher. Now, little bit put your"]],[6010,["right hand like this. Bend your head, and","see for yourself if there is a cool breeze"]],[6017,["coming out of your head. But don’t touch","it – above your head, above your head. And"]],[6026,["some people get it far. So just try to feel","if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your"]],[6033,["head. Now, don’t start doubting that it’s","air-conditioning and all that – air-conditioning"]],[6040,["cannot come out of your head! So see for yourself.","Now, put","your left hand towards Me. Now again bend"]],[6056,["your head, and see for yourself if there’s","a cool breeze coming out of your head. All"]],[6072,["right? Now put your right hand again, and","again bend your head and see for yourself"]],[6081,["if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your","head. It might be hot also, doesn’t matter."]],[6087,["It may be heat coming out first and then the","cool breeze. Doesn’t matter if it is hot,"]],[6094,["doesn’t matter."]],[6096,["Now, put your both the hands towards the sky","like this. Bend back, and ask Me a question."]],[6108,["Three times, you can ask Me the question,","“Mother, is this the cool breeze of the"]],[6114,["Holy Ghost? Mother, is this the all-pervading","Power of divine love? Mother, is this the"]],[6124,["Paramachaitanya?” Ask any one of these questions","three times."]],[6137,["Now put down your hands. Now watch Me without","thinking. You can do it. Those who have felt"]],[6152,["the cool breeze in their hands or out of their","fontanel bone area, whether cool or hot, please"]],[6161,["raise both your hands – both. Let’s see.","Just see the en masse, just see – wonderful!"]],[6172,["So may God bless you all."]],[6176,["I bow to you all, because you have started","now your saintly life. And all those who didn’t"]],[6183,["get also should not get disappointed. On the","contrary, if time permits I would like to"]],[6191,["meet the people who have felt the cool breeze,","and those who haven’t felt can come on this"]],[6196,["side and the Sahaja yogis can work on them.","Again tomorrow you must come so you’ll be"]],[6202,["fixed properly. Some, those who want to meet","Me can come and see Me, because there is some"]],[6207,["time, and in the meanwhile we can have some","music. Now don’t think about it. If you"]],[6217,["start thinking, you’ll be lost. Just don’t","think about it; it’s beyond thinking."]],[6222,["Thank you very much. Thank you. Beautiful!","Oh, My! Thank you. It’s beautiful flowers."]],[6228,["If you can push this apart, I’d like to","meet people."]],[6233,["[Bhajans]"]]]);
